{"id":"vod_zy360_67555","vodId":"67555","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"命运石之门","name_cn":"命运石之门","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"国产动漫","remarks":"全25集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20241103-1/67c8ab9ef0d1f83da1c31ed4ee0d1768.jpg"},"summary":"本作主人公冈部伦太郎（宫野真守配音）是个患有严重中二病的大学生，自称为“凤凰院凶真”的他和伙伴们组成了“未来发明研究所”，在位于秋叶原的一个简陋实验室内进行各种古怪发明和调查。2010年7月28日这天，冈部和青梅竹马真由理（花泽香菜配音）一同去了科学讲义会场，在那里，他们遇见了天才少女牧濑红莉栖（今井麻美配音）。让人意想不到的事情发生了，冈部在会馆楼道内听到一声惨叫，他闻声而至，发现了倒在血泊中的牧濑。冈部用手机短信将这件事告诉好友桥田至，这个举动，让世界都颠覆了。实验室里那个所谓的“未来道具”，竟然真的可以左右世界的进程，冈部自此成了孤独的观测者。这一切都是命运石之门的选择。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-11-03 21:06:44","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/mG0UChCz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/dxMJGx50/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/RftscDPB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/YDf6DRqL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/ZVnEcmhG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/H2nrD3Hy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/GqDKbe07/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/pqw6zUWF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/AIilZmNB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/3sdaXqrw/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/wbBre8dK/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/XdqFaEed/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/mDkmBVQk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/1XDprizK/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241103/OuQc